# RIMSHIRE: a foe knocked into one of your disks takes that disk's own
# melee (a warden's 2); your disk is not hurt.
game rimshire
cheat war 1
cheat cpu 1 -1
cheat army 0 SW
cheat army 1 S
cheat battle 6 1 0
cheat field 0
cheat unshuffle
cheat place 0 100 128
cheat place 1 200 128
cheat place 2 160 128
waituntil bphase == 1 200
press A
hold RIGHT 40
hold A 40
wait 1
waituntil moving == 0 600
expect d2_hp == 2
expect d1_hp == 8
expect d0_hp == 5
